  {
    "name": "Offer Engine",
    "story": "Customer 360 profiles feed a real-time decision endpoint that picks the best offer per shopper in milliseconds. A recommender scores every program, region and daypart and proposes changes ranked by profit, kept only if return on spend stays above the 10.1% target. The agent applies small changes within Unity Catalog limits and logs them with Undo; bigger moves wait for approval (D4 open). The app shows return on spend, recommendations and programs, with reports exported to EPM. No individual shoppers on screen.",
